{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "772c278b-3a34-84ce-910f-fa4a30c5bfe8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:32:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:30:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Sean Kearney. I am calling on behalf of my mother, who lives at 460 Gibbs Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. I would like to ask about her water and sewer bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Is the account in her name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, no. On the other hand, it is still in my father's name. He passed some years ago and nobody changed it. Is that a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for answering general questions, and she can get it switched over later. What do you need today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:30:54-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would like a breakdown of the usage month by month, for the past year if possible. I am making a budget for her, you see. The bills come and the number jumps around, and on the other hand she cannot tell me why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:31:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Bills here are usually based on meter reads, so some months can look bigger if a read lands late. Let me pull up the address. Can you spell the last name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "K-E-A-R-N-E-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. [pause] Yep, I see it. I can't read out every month over the phone right now, but I can have a usage history printed or mailed to her. Or if you give me an email, I can send it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail is better. She does not use the computer. On the other hand, I will be at her house on Saturday, so mailing to the same address is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:31:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, I'll put in the request to that address. Should be there in a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. One more question. If she wishes to pay outside of regular hours, is there a way to pay by phone after four-thirty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:32:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's an online payment option on the city website that works any time. There's also a drop box outside City Hall for checks. For paying by phone, we take payments during office hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:32:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. The website is not for her, but the drop box is workable. On the other hand, I may just pay it myself online. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:32:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:32:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Although, her neighbor has been repainting the same shutter for a month. I do not understand it. Anyway, thank you, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:32:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Take care now."
    }
  ],
